{"sections":[{"slug":"几何态射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何态射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何态射"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若将</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">视为某种几何对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">几何态射</span></strong> (geometric morphism) <span lang=\"zh\">就是这种几何对象之间合适的映射的概念</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">意象之间还有其它的态射的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逻辑态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逻辑态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个几何态射是一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">这个概念抽象自拓扑空间的连续映射的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像-逆像伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">逆像伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的几何态射</span>\n$$\r\nf\\colon \\mathcal F \\to \\mathcal  E\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由一对伴随函子</span> $f^*\\colon \\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F$, $f_*\\colon \\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">左正合</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有限极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有限极限</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与拓扑空间的映射的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">几何映射</span> $\\operatorname{Sh}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Sh}(Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一确定了</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与逻辑的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">几何态射保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何逻辑","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何逻辑</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的公式</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个意象</span> $\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的箭头</span> $k\\colon B\\to A$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">换基</span>” (change of base) <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>\n$$\r\nk^* \\colon \\mathcal E/A \\to \\mathcal E/B.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它同时具有左伴随</span> $\\sum_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">与右伴随</span> $\\prod_k$. <span lang=\"zh\">于是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它给出了几何态射</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal E/B\\to\\mathcal E/A,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $k_*=\\prod_k$. <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $k^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">左正合是由于它存在左伴随</span> $\\sum_k$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何态射的性质","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射的性质</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}